    },
    {
      "id": "ch8FYv0_m9G6I8w9-lzpX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3902.5109154030297,
      "y": -3650.5208226507866,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 205,
      "text": "CONFIRMED BOOKING\n\nOne DB transaction owns all selected seats.\nA replay returns the existing booking;\nit does not fail just because holds are gone.\n\nThe successful customer keeps the ticket\neven when Redis needs repair.",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "groupIds": [],
      "seed": 746133694,
      "version": 55,
      "versionNonce": 754627582,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792310017438,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "b85",
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "created": 1792310015908,
      "originalText": "CONFIRMED BOOKING\n\nOne DB transaction owns all selected seats.\nA replay returns the existing booking;\nit does not fail just because holds are gone.\n\nThe successful customer keeps the ticket\neven when Redis needs repair.",
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "lrIAsnIWK5XPTxA7rPAai",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": -3407.5109154030297,
      "y": -3670.5208226507866,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 245,
      "strokeColor": "#e67700",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff9db",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 26431742,
      "version": 55,
      "versionNonce": 1010373346,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792310017438,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "b86",
      "frameId": null,
      "created": 1792310015908
    },
    {
      "id": "ejo63tEyInL30M_QBpIqF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3387.5109154030297,
      "y": -3650.5208226507866,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 205,
      "text": "EXPIRED HOLD / ALLOCATION CONFLICT\n\nNo second confirmed ticket is issued.\nIf money was collected: persist refund work\nand reconcile with the payment provider.\nRelease only holds owned by the losing booking.\nOn a sold-seat conflict, repair Redis from DB.\nNever delete another customer's hold blindly.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "groupIds": [],
      "seed": 1597800766,
      "version": 55,
      "versionNonce": 230655038,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792310017438,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "b87",
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "created": 1792310015908,
      "originalText": "EXPIRED HOLD / ALLOCATION CONFLICT\n\nNo second confirmed ticket is issued.\nIf money was collected: persist refund work\nand reconcile with the payment provider.\nRelease only holds owned by the losing booking.\nOn a sold-seat conflict, repair Redis from DB.\nNever delete another customer's hold blindly.",
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "tkgyzSGaLz7YBoOcHTvvD",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": -2862.5109154030297,
      "y": -3670.5208226507866,
      "width": 510,
      "height": 245,
      "strokeColor": "#e67700",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff9db",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 1221962110,
      "version": 55,
      "versionNonce": 1394108066,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792310017438,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "b88",
      "frameId": null,
      "created": 1792310015908
    },
    {
      "id": "S_uVyQP9mZT_2vP_0WlH7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2842.5109154030297,
      "y": -3650.5208226507866,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 205,
      "text": "DB COMMITTED; REDIS UPDATE FAILED\n\nLog / measure the failure; return ticket success.\nA reconciliation worker reapplies DB-confirmed\nsold seats to Redis until the update succeeds.\nDB is the authority; stale Redis can grant bad holds.\n\nOptional stronger delivery: a PostgreSQL outbox\nwritten in the same booking transaction.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "groupIds": [],
      "seed": 765446590,
      "version": 55,
      "versionNonce": 1442860158,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792310017438,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "b89",
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "created": 1792310015908,
      "originalText": "DB COMMITTED; REDIS UPDATE FAILED\n\nLog / measure the failure; return ticket success.\nA reconciliation worker reapplies DB-confirmed\nsold seats to Redis until the update succeeds.\nDB is the authority; stale Redis can grant bad holds.\n\nOptional stronger delivery: a PostgreSQL outbox\nwritten in the same booking transaction.",
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "pCXVRZad2IIf_3awNw-Vp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3922.5109154030297,
      "y": -3400.5208226507866,
      "width": 1540,
      "height": 50,
      "text": "Unknown PostgreSQL commit outcome -> look up booking_id before refunding or retrying. Database unavailable -> no new ticket confirmation.\nVerified callbacks and unfinished payment attempts must be durably recorded / reconciled so a service restart does not lose paid work.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "containerId": null,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "groupIds": [],
      "seed": 1824252414,
      "version": 55,
      "versionNonce": 1113014882,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792310017438,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "b8A",
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "created": 1792310015908,
      "originalText": "Unknown PostgreSQL commit outcome -> look up booking_id before refunding or retrying. Database unavailable -> no new ticket confirmation.\nVerified callbacks and unfinished payment attempts must be durably recorded / reconciled so a service restart does not lose paid work.",
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2AEZr9FB-v1V6nWsk3Rzq",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": -3967.5109154030297,
      "y": -3290.5208226507866,
      "width": 810,
      "height": 610,
      "strokeColor": "#c92a2a",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff5f5",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "groupIds": [],
