    },
    {
      "id": "hYOwJoqoIrGjvk_gQLDfa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3937.5109154030297,
      "y": -3265.5208226507866,
      "width": 750,
      "height": 35,
      "text": "4. Redis model: no expiresAt field required",
      "fontSize": 25,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "containerId": null,
      "strokeColor": "#c92a2a",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "groupIds": [],
      "seed": 1036909182,
      "version": 55,
      "versionNonce": 1690609186,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792310017438,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "b8C",
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "created": 1792310015908,
      "originalText": "4. Redis model: no expiresAt field required",
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "xo0hdPJ2KjbvhMaIIeKEJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3932.5109154030297,
      "y": -3200.5208226507866,
      "width": 740,
      "height": 265,
      "text": "Permanent hash: event:{E1}:seats\n  1 -> AVAILABLE\n  2 -> AVAILABLE\n  3 -> BOOKED (bookingId: B3)\n\nTemporary key: hold:{E1}:2\n  JSON: { reservationId: R1, userId: U1 }\n  TTL: 600 seconds\n  Optional: bookingId / orderId when known\n\nSeat identifiers: 1..N for each event.",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "containerId": null,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "groupIds": [],
      "seed": 1634073278,
      "version": 55,
      "versionNonce": 869909758,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792310017438,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "b8D",
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "created": 1792310015908,
      "originalText": "Permanent hash: event:{E1}:seats\n  1 -> AVAILABLE\n  2 -> AVAILABLE\n  3 -> BOOKED (bookingId: B3)\n\nTemporary key: hold:{E1}:2\n  JSON: { reservationId: R1, userId: U1 }\n  TTL: 600 seconds\n  Optional: bookingId / orderId when known\n\nSeat identifiers: 1..N for each event.",
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Y26pI3A_LhQ8Hg_6lU1dc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3932.5109154030297,
      "y": -2910.5208226507866,
      "width": 740,
      "height": 205,
      "text": "Effective seat-map status:\n  BOOKED in permanent hash -> BOOKED\n  Otherwise, active hold key -> RESERVED\n  Otherwise -> AVAILABLE\n\nTTL removes the entire hold; no move between seat arrays.\nHGETALL / HMGET + batched MGET for hold keys.\nRedis Cluster: same-event keys share the {E1} hash tag\nso multi-key scripts execute in one slot.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "containerId": null,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "groupIds": [],
      "seed": 177468158,
      "version": 55,
      "versionNonce": 1666159074,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792310017438,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "b8E",
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "created": 1792310015908,
      "originalText": "Effective seat-map status:\n  BOOKED in permanent hash -> BOOKED\n  Otherwise, active hold key -> RESERVED\n  Otherwise -> AVAILABLE\n\nTTL removes the entire hold; no move between seat arrays.\nHGETALL / HMGET + batched MGET for hold keys.\nRedis Cluster: same-event keys share the {E1} hash tag\nso multi-key scripts execute in one slot.",
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "YRNaFD6gb8fCSveS4vHl2",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": -3117.5109154030297,
      "y": -3290.5208226507866,
      "width": 810,
      "height": 610,
      "strokeColor": "#6741d9",
      "backgroundColor": "#f3f0ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 64545598,
      "version": 55,
      "versionNonce": 1754559806,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792310017438,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "b8F",
      "frameId": null,
      "created": 1792310015908
    },
    {
      "id": "w0pre_IDsP1Qp0hcuD_Vw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3087.5109154030297,
      "y": -3265.5208226507866,
      "width": 750,
      "height": 35,
      "text": "5. Guarantees, recovery and deliberate tradeoffs",
      "fontSize": 25,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "containerId": null,
      "strokeColor": "#6741d9",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "groupIds": [],
      "seed": 529910654,
      "version": 55,
      "versionNonce": 1896285602,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792310017438,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "b8G",
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "created": 1792310015908,
      "originalText": "5. Guarantees, recovery and deliberate tradeoffs",
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hqSYmSdtxJlGhhbxzHp9U",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3082.5109154030297,
      "y": -3200.5208226507866,
      "width": 740,
      "height": 500,
      "text": "STRICT CONFIRMED SEAT OWNERSHIP\nPostgreSQL uniqueness + transaction prevent two confirmed\nbookings owning the same (event_id, seat_id).\nStable booking / payment IDs make retries idempotent.\n\nFAST BUT POTENTIALLY STALE AVAILABILITY\nRedis grants temporary holds, not guaranteed tickets.\nStale Redis can lead to a rejected paid attempt and refund.\nNo claim of strongly consistent seat-map reads.\n\nREDIS LOSS / REBUILD\nGate new holds during recovery. Restore confirmed sold seats\nfrom PostgreSQL before reopening. Reconcile in-flight payments\nand lost holds; do not treat an empty Redis as an empty venue.\n\nPOSTGRESQL REPAIR OF REDIS\nUse repeatable reconciliation; outbox is an optional mechanism.\nRedis errors do not invalidate already-committed tickets.\n\nDEFERRED / NOT ASSUMED\nEvent creation and initialization are outside this review.\nNo Redis Stream / async PostgreSQL confirmation in this version.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "containerId": null,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "groupIds": [],
      "seed": 1007397822,
      "version": 55,
      "versionNonce": 1259281790,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792310017438,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "b8H",
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "created": 1792310015908,
      "originalText": "STRICT CONFIRMED SEAT OWNERSHIP\nPostgreSQL uniqueness + transaction prevent two confirmed\nbookings owning the same (event_id, seat_id).\nStable booking / payment IDs make retries idempotent.\n\nFAST BUT POTENTIALLY STALE AVAILABILITY\nRedis grants temporary holds, not guaranteed tickets.\nStale Redis can lead to a rejected paid attempt and refund.\nNo claim of strongly consistent seat-map reads.\n\nREDIS LOSS / REBUILD\nGate new holds during recovery. Restore confirmed sold seats\nfrom PostgreSQL before reopening. Reconcile in-flight payments\nand lost holds; do not treat an empty Redis as an empty venue.\n\nPOSTGRESQL REPAIR OF REDIS\nUse repeatable reconciliation; outbox is an optional mechanism.\nRedis errors do not invalidate already-committed tickets.\n\nDEFERRED / NOT ASSUMED\nEvent creation and initialization are outside this review.\nNo Redis Stream / async PostgreSQL confirmation in this version.",
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
