      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "User Select Seat\n\n- Booking Table Entry Moved to Reserved State\n- Booking service moves creates the Payment order \n- Payemnt Order will be returned to the Cliens\n- Client will do payment\n- Payment Confirmation Event  from 3P to\nBooking/Payment Service\n- Booking Entry will be moved to COmpleted State",
