    {
      "id": "Px0Nz4KL5rMhowRvs8SVG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3350.399080908758,
      "y": -3479.6290604921396,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 205,
      "text": "CONFIRMED BOOKING\n\nOne DB transaction owns all selected seats.\nA replay returns the existing booking;\nit does not fail just because holds are gone.\n\nThe successful customer keeps the ticket\neven when Redis needs repair.",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "groupIds": [],
      "seed": 1522276258,
      "version": 54,
      "versionNonce": 1908454718,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792310018798,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "bAB",
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "created": 1792310018797,
      "originalText": "CONFIRMED BOOKING\n\nOne DB transaction owns all selected seats.\nA replay returns the existing booking;\nit does not fail just because holds are gone.\n\nThe successful customer keeps the ticket\neven when Redis needs repair.",
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "-l3NPGcvDaGq3T64aGr7f",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": -2855.399080908758,
      "y": -3499.6290604921396,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 245,
      "strokeColor": "#e67700",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff9db",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 1549587298,
      "version": 54,
      "versionNonce": 264160674,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792310018798,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "bAC",
      "frameId": null,
      "created": 1792310018797
    },
    {
      "id": "ZTvto00dzaiCBCZATXG85",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2835.399080908758,
      "y": -3479.6290604921396,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 205,
      "text": "EXPIRED HOLD / ALLOCATION CONFLICT\n\nNo second confirmed ticket is issued.\nIf money was collected: persist refund work\nand reconcile with the payment provider.\nRelease only holds owned by the losing booking.\nOn a sold-seat conflict, repair Redis from DB.\nNever delete another customer's hold blindly.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "groupIds": [],
      "seed": 703600418,
      "version": 54,
      "versionNonce": 1689476478,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792310018798,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "bAD",
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "created": 1792310018797,
      "originalText": "EXPIRED HOLD / ALLOCATION CONFLICT\n\nNo second confirmed ticket is issued.\nIf money was collected: persist refund work\nand reconcile with the payment provider.\nRelease only holds owned by the losing booking.\nOn a sold-seat conflict, repair Redis from DB.\nNever delete another customer's hold blindly.",
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "jy4Iujly7KKFKcIrgrBC-",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": -2310.399080908758,
      "y": -3499.6290604921396,
      "width": 510,
      "height": 245,
      "strokeColor": "#e67700",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff9db",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 870638306,
      "version": 54,
      "versionNonce": 2027536738,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792310018798,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "bAE",
      "frameId": null,
      "created": 1792310018797
    },
    {
      "id": "5HC3v2y2CViymQxDWkPci",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2290.399080908758,
      "y": -3479.6290604921396,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 205,
      "text": "DB COMMITTED; REDIS UPDATE FAILED\n\nLog / measure the failure; return ticket success.\nA reconciliation worker reapplies DB-confirmed\nsold seats to Redis until the update succeeds.\nDB is the authority; stale Redis can grant bad holds.\n\nOptional stronger delivery: a PostgreSQL outbox\nwritten in the same booking transaction.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "groupIds": [],
      "seed": 80361122,
      "version": 54,
      "versionNonce": 1806106046,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792310018798,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "bAF",
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "created": 1792310018797,
      "originalText": "DB COMMITTED; REDIS UPDATE FAILED\n\nLog / measure the failure; return ticket success.\nA reconciliation worker reapplies DB-confirmed\nsold seats to Redis until the update succeeds.\nDB is the authority; stale Redis can grant bad holds.\n\nOptional stronger delivery: a PostgreSQL outbox\nwritten in the same booking transaction.",
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "oiN535abMb1957eqfKmWI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3370.399080908758,
      "y": -3229.6290604921396,
      "width": 1540,
      "height": 50,
      "text": "Unknown PostgreSQL commit outcome -> look up booking_id before refunding or retrying. Database unavailable -> no new ticket confirmation.\nVerified callbacks and unfinished payment attempts must be durably recorded / reconciled so a service restart does not lose paid work.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "containerId": null,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "groupIds": [],
      "seed": 2102334050,
      "version": 54,
      "versionNonce": 1151288610,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792310018798,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "bAG",
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "created": 1792310018797,
      "originalText": "Unknown PostgreSQL commit outcome -> look up booking_id before refunding or retrying. Database unavailable -> no new ticket confirmation.\nVerified callbacks and unfinished payment attempts must be durably recorded / reconciled so a service restart does not lose paid work.",
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "grePsrbO1DtfaJ78cwyWz",
