      "y": -184.98978643284136,
      "width": 490,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "TICKET SUCCESS = POSTGRESQL COMMIT\n\nTry Redis update after the DB commit.\nFailure -> log + repair, not ticket failure.\nUnknown DB outcome -> look up booking ID.\nNever confirm without a known DB commit.",
